  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating State-Owned Enterprises Transformation Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed results-based lending (RBL) program aims to significantly improve the financial sustainability and service delivery performance of 39 of Pakistan&apos;s commercial state-owned enterprises (SOEs) and National Highway Authority (NHA), the largest loss-maker in the country&apos;s SOE portfolio. These SOEs place a considerable burden on overall economic productivity and undermine the government&apos;s overarching goal of a prosperous, equitable, and thriving economy.</narrative>
  </description>
